# Linear CLI (profile-owned)

Use the profile-owned `linear` command. It calls Linear's official GraphQL API.

- Auth: `LINEAR_API_KEY`, else `~/.local/share/fleet/linear-token` (mode 600)
- Never print, log, or commit the token
- Never install `@schpet/linear-cli` or the 2021 `@linear/cli` (`lin`)
- MCP is optional fallback only when `linear` is unavailable in that harness
